{
 "name": "HL · Prospects · find, research, score, draft",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Prospects: find, research, score, draft (Lesson 5.2)\nGoogle Places Text Search (one call per area) -> read each website -> extract facts -> verify the quote in code -> score in code from the ICP sheet -> AI draft -> lint in code -> Prospects sheet (status drafted). Nothing is sent here.\n\nSheets (YOUR_SHEET_ID):\n- ICP: rule, points (rating_4 20, reviews_100 20, delivery 25, office_lunch 15, in_zone 20)\n- Prospects: place_id, status, fit_score, reasons, fact, fact_source, draft, subject, business_email, approved_at, sent_at, followup_sent_at, reply_type\n- Manual list: place_id, reason, date\nNo copied Google data: only the place ID is stored.\n\nCredentials: Header Auth \"Google Places key\" (Name X-Goog-Api-Key, Value your key) on Places Text Search; Google Sheets; OpenAI on both model nodes.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_MODEL.\nSet a budget alert in Google Cloud before the first run.",
    "height": 520,
    "width": 540
   },
